  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Cut the tomato into thin wedges. Thinly slice the onion. Coarsely grate the cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2318740/photos/large/119761_1-61e5816924abb5f7d83c7dd0f38d8597.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Marinate onion: Combine 1 tbs olive oil and 2 tsp balsamic vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add half the onion and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2318741/photos/large/119761_2-3c17b16b4c0580773edee538a1bf4266.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sauce: Combine the tomato paste and 2 tsp Aussie barbecue seasoning in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2318742/photos/large/119761_3-a58d38f3a110a9d052a00122b99c9939.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble and bake pizzas: Put the pita on the lined tray. Spread with the sauce and top with half the spinach and the remaining onion. Arrange the tomato wedges around the edge of each pita, then crack 2 eggs into the centre of each one (the tomato will help prevent the egg spilling over the side). Scatter over the cheese. Bake the pizzas for 13-15 mins until golden (see Make it yours).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2318743/photos/large/119761_4-96b3c185b277bf8a76bca05db45b1ad6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the remaining spinach to the marinated onion and toss to combine. Drizzle the aioli over the pizzas and scatter over the remaining Aussie barbecue seasoning. Serve the pizzas with the salad and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2318744/photos/large/119761_5-bd4fad214b4c98af0b60a8d69ed69100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you prefer a runny egg yolk, bake the pizzas for 11-12 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2318745/photos/large/119761_6-9714c3e43d2bdfc6a13b5f99379ebff2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
